Z||000003||turbo86se||04-07-2001||12:08 PM||||Thanks for the compliements, I appreciate it! <P>JoeJoe, my mechanic is famous for taking his time. But his work is outstanding. About three years ago, I came across a mint 88 Formula that needed a new head gasket. I bought the car and the parts, he did the work, and I signed the title over to him in exchange for a V6 in my coupe. I gave him that Fiero b/c at the time he had nothing else. So this is a trade-out. All the parts are sitting in the car, and I'm just waiting on him, as usual. <BR>My mechanic painted the car too. I had to replace the passenger door, fender, hood, windshield from a 85 coupe. The reds didn't match, so I decided on bright yellow, and it turned heads everywhere!<BR>Guess who I'm going to call and bug now?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
